<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>PROPOSAL 2:</B> To approve a special resolution,
that the Company&rsquo;s name be changed from &ldquo;Color Star Technology Co., Ltd.&rdquo; to &ldquo;Zeta Network Group&rdquo; (the &ldquo;<B>Name
Change Proposal</B>&rdquo;);</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

