<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>PROPOSAL 3: </B>Subject to the approval and
implementation of the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation, and the approval of the change of the Company&rsquo;s name (the &ldquo;<B>Name
Change</B>&rdquo;), as a special resolution, that the Seventh Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company,
a copy of which is attached to the accompanying proxy statement as Appendix A, subject to adjustment solely in respect of the final Approved
Consolidation Ratio (the &ldquo;<B>Amended M&amp;A</B>&rdquo;), be adopted in substitution for, and to the exclusion of, the existing
Sixth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association of the Company (the &ldquo;<B>Articles Amendment Proposal</B>&rdquo;)
to reflect the alteration of the share capital as a result of the Reverse Share Split and Share Consolidation and the Name Change; adoption
of the Articles Amendment Proposal to be approved as a special resolution;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
