<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>PROPOSAL 10: </B>To ratify, confirm and approve
the appointment of Assentsure PAC as the Company&rsquo;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending June
30, 2025 (the &ldquo;<B>Ratification of Appointment of Auditors Proposal</B>&rdquo;); ratification of the Appointment of Auditors Proposal
to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

